  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * @param[in]  shiftBits number of bits to shift.  A positive value shifts left; a negative value s
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * @param[out]  *pDst points to the output vector
