  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * @return none.
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  *
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * \par Conditions for optimum performance
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  *  Input and output buffers should be aligned by 32-bit
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  *
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  *
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
