  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * The function uses saturating arithmetic.
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  * Results outside of the allowable Q7 range [0x8 0x7F] will be saturated.
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_shift_q7.c ****  */
